Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value MODE (\S+)
Value DYNAMIC_USER (\d+)
Value STATIC_USER (\d+)
Value MAX_USER (\d+|unlimited)
Value AUTHENED (yes|no)
Value MAB (active|disable)

Start
  # 跳过表头行和分隔线
  ^Interface\s+Mode\s+Dynamic-User\s+Static-User\s+Max-User\s+Authened\s+MAB -> Next
  ^-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+ -> Next
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${MODE}\s+${DYNAMIC_USER}\s+${STATIC_USER}\s+${MAX_USER}\s+${AUTHENED}\s+${MAB}\s -> Record